CC-BY-SA-4.0 (UPFD-derived records)
-----------------------------------
These records are a cleaned, schema-mapped derivative of UPFD
(Dou, Shu, Xia, Yu, and Sun, "User Preference-aware Fake News Detection",
SIGIR 2021; https://github.com/safe-graph/GNN-FakeNews), which is licensed
CC-BY-SA-4.0. The derivative inherits that license.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The two data licenses are not freely combinable: redistributing a merged
derivative of both subsets requires care. The metadata.tier field on every
record identifies which license applies.

